## 4. Quick “drop‑in” replacement for your current rule

If you just want a one‑liner that fixes the most common false‑positives, replace your condition with:

```js
if (layer.type === 'symbol' &&
    typeof layer.layout?.['icon-image'] === 'string' &&          // has an icon
    typeof layer.layout?.['text-field'] === 'string' &&         // has a label
    /^[\dA-Z]+(?:[-–]\d+)?$/.test(layer.layout['text-field'].replace(/[{}]/g, '')) // looks like a route number
) {
    // → treat as a shield
}
```

